ition to his long sharp  teeth  he's also mostly bald except for an  orangish red tuft of hair on each side  of his head  the Pennywise of the movie doesn't quite  resemble what King originally imagined  but he's still the kind of clown you  wouldn't want to run across at a  carnival  so it works thanks for watching click  the looper icon to subscribe to our  YouTube channel plus check out all the  school stuff we know you'll love to
 

